    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1531" root="اوه" body-key="A">
    
      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تأوّه</span></b> ; (S, Mgh, Msb, K;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أوّه</span></b> , (S, Mgh,
K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَأْوِيةٌ</span>; (S, K;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آهَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْهٌ</span>;
(K;) <i>He said</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آهِ</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْهِ</span> &amp;c. [i. e. <i>Ah!</i> or <i>alas!</i>];
(S, Mgh, K;) <i>he moaned;</i> or <i>uttered a moan,</i> or
<i>moaning,</i> or <i>prolonged voice of complaint;</i> (S,
TA;) <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَوَجَّعَ</span>. (Msb.)

